---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="用 AI 协作重学计算机系统"
  description="Build Your Own X · 每日学习实验。把复杂系统拆成一天一个主题，借助 AI 协作持续产出 README 与学习卡。"
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-badge">超级个体实践 · 持续更新专题</div>
    <h1>用 AI 协作重学计算机系统</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Build Your Own X · 每日学习实验</p>
    <p class="hero-description">
      我把复杂系统拆成“一天一个主题”的长期学习项目：每天选一个系统主题，借助 AI 协作生成
      README、学习卡和可公开展示的学习成果。目标不是快速刷项目，而是把系统理解、表达能力和个人工作流一起练出来。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="primary-button" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 GitHub 仓库</a>
      <a class="secondary-button" href="#featured-preview">看精选预览</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-label">WHY</div>
    <h2>为什么做这个实验</h2>
    <div class="copy-grid">
      <div class="copy-card">
        <h3>把抽象知识变成可执行理解</h3>
        <p>
          平时学操作系统、网络、数据库，容易停留在“知道名词”的阶段。只有逼自己去解释一个系统怎么工作、为什么这么设计、边界在哪，理解才会真正变深。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="copy-card">
        <h3>验证 AI 协作是否能放大学习效率</h3>
        <p>
          这不是单纯让 AI 帮我写总结，而是测试：当 AI 负责组织、草拟、制图和整理时，我能不能把更多精力放在判断、校正和提炼上。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="copy-card">
        <h3>沉淀一套可持续的个人学习流水线</h3>
        <p>
          每天一个主题、统一产物结构、持续更新进度。这样做出来的不是零散笔记，而是一套能长期积累的公开作品专题。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-label">METHOD</div>
    <h2>我的方法</h2>
    <div class="method-grid">
      <div class="method-step">
        <span class="step-index">01</span>
        <h3>选一个系统主题</h3>
        <p>从 build-your-own-x 中挑一个可独立讲清楚的主题，例如 Web Server、Web Browser、Network Stack。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="method-step">
        <span class="step-index">02</span>
        <h3>让 AI 辅助搭骨架</h3>
        <p>让 AI 帮我整理资料、组织结构、起草 README 和学习卡内容，但不把判断权交出去。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="method-step">
        <span class="step-index">03</span>
        <h3>按原理重新校正</h3>
        <p>重点检查“这是什么、怎么用、核心原理、适用场景与边界”是否讲透，避免只停留在工具介绍层。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="method-step">
        <span class="step-index">04</span>
        <h3>产出公开可展示成果</h3>
        <p>每个主题至少沉淀 README 和一张学习卡，让这次学习能被复用、被展示、也能回头复盘。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="featured-preview" class="content-section">
    <div class="section-label">FEATURED</div>
    <h2>精选预览</h2>
    <div class="featured-panel">
      <div class="featured-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Day 09 · Network Stack</div>
        <h3>从分层到 TCP 可靠性，把网络通信重新拆开看清楚</h3>
        <p>
          这张卡系统梳理了网络栈的核心概念：分层模型、封装与解封装、MAC / IP / 端口、路由与转发，以及 TCP 的可靠性机制。
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>适合作为专题页中的高信息密度代表作</li>
          <li>统一暗色科技风，和站点视觉一致</li>
          <li>点击可查看原始仓库中的完整学习产物</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="inline-link" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning/tree/main/day-09-network-stack" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 Day 09 目录 →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="featured-image-shell">
        <img src="/build-your-own-x/day-09-network-stack-learning-card.png" alt="Day 09 Network Stack 学习卡预览" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="section-label">PROGRESS</div>
    <h2>当前进度</h2>
    <div class="progress-grid">
      <a class="progress-card" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning/tree/main/day-07-web-server" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="progress-day">Day 07</div>
        <h3>Web Server</h3>
        <p>从请求处理、路由、连接模型出发，理解一个服务端最小可用闭环。</p>
        <span>已完成</span>
      </a>
      <a class="progress-card" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning/tree/main/day-08-web-browser" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="progress-day">Day 08</div>
        <h3>Web Browser</h3>
        <p>把浏览器拆成解析、渲染、资源加载几个核心环节重新理解。</p>
        <span>已完成</span>
      </a>
      <a class="progress-card" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning/tree/main/day-09-network-stack" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="progress-day">Day 09</div>
        <h3>Network Stack</h3>
        <p>从分层模型到 TCP 可靠性，这张卡系统梳理了网络栈的核心概念与数据传输路径。</p>
        <span>已完成</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section repo-section">
    <div class="section-label">REPO</div>
    <h2>完整项目入口</h2>
    <p>
      如果你想看完整学习轨迹、每日 README、原始学习卡和后续更新，可以直接进入 GitHub 仓库。这个专题页负责展示方法与代表作，仓库负责承载持续更新的完整记录。
    </p>
    <a class="primary-button" href="https://github.com/okbexx/build-your-own-x-learning" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开 build-your-own-x-learning</a>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero-section {
      padding: 56px 0 44px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .hero-badge,
    .section-label,
    .eyebrow {
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-section h1 {
      font-size: 52px;
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -1.4px;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--purple);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-description,
    .repo-section p {
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .primary-button,
    .secondary-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease;
    }

    .primary-button {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18), rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.18));
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.34);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .secondary-button {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .primary-button:hover,
    .secondary-button:hover,
    .progress-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .content-section {
      padding: 36px 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .content-section h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    }

    .copy-grid,
    .method-grid,
    .progress-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .copy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    }

    .method-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    }

    .progress-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    }

    .copy-card,
    .method-step,
    .progress-card,
    .featured-panel,
    .repo-section {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.98), rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.96));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    }

    .copy-card,
    .method-step {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .copy-card h3,
    .method-step h3,
    .progress-card h3,
    .featured-copy h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .copy-card p,
    .method-step p,
    .progress-card p,
    .featured-copy p,
    .featured-copy li,
    .repo-section p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .step-index,
    .progress-day {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }

    .featured-panel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(320px, 0.95fr);
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .featured-copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .featured-copy ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .inline-link {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .featured-image-shell {
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.16);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    }

    .featured-image-shell img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .progress-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .progress-card span {
      width: fit-content;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.24);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .repo-section {
      padding: 28px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-section h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .featured-panel {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .hero-section {
        padding-top: 36px;
      }

      .hero-section h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .hero-subtitle {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .content-section h2 {
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .primary-button,
      .secondary-button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
